  "description": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">Allett is a carry goods company started in 1995 with a sole purpose - to address injuries and back programs associated with carrying a bulky wallet. So the Allett Original Wallet was born - a patented wallet design with an extremely slim profile and impressive storage capacity. Even to this day, the Original remains one of our best-selling items.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">Headquartered in San Diego, California, our lifestyle inspires our products. We&rsquo;re a group of active people that like to play outdoors, and equally, enjoy cleaning up for a night out in the city. And this is reflected in our choice of materials, from technical rip-stop nylons to elevated nappa leathers in bold color combinations of brights and neutrals. We thoughtfully use high-quality, lightweight materials that are innovative and eco-conscious.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">And like the humans who carry them, our products are truly designed and made for more.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">We want you to be authentic to your audience and stay true to who you are, so we ask that you only post and create content if you truly enjoy using our wallets. Is that you? Do you want to sample the goods?</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; border-bottom-width: 0.5pt; border-bottom-style: solid; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-bottom: 1pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">To start, apply to be an Allett affiliate via the provided link. Once approved, shoot us an email, and we&rsquo;ll supply you with a free wallet of your choice. Then you can start promoting, generating sales, and earning 15% on every purchase!</span></p>",
